mboy with a strong sense of justice. But she\u2019s actually quite shy.<br></li><li>Kanon Matsuura<br>A young and famous pop star. A little spoiled and likes to do things her own way.</li></ul><br>\u203bThis is a puzzle game with sexy characters (no nudity). Characters and character images used under license from their respective owners.",
